; Shapes: the Stamp brush's grids (docs/tool-refinement-plan.md Phase 6,
; Game/Carve.h). Pick one in the palette's Shapes section, click it down on the
; map, R turns it a quarter.
;
; Fields:
;   display   the shape's name, as the palette lists it.
;   rows      the grid, rows split by '|':
;               '.'  opens the square (painted in the current style's ROOM theme)
;               '#'  makes it solid - a pillar, or a wall the shape needs
;               '-'  (or anything else) leaves the square as it was
;             It is placed centred on the square clicked.

[round_chamber]
display = Round Chamber
rows = --...--|-.....-|.......|.......|.......|-.....-|--...--

[cross_hall]
display = Cross Hall
rows = --...--|--...--|.......|.......|.......|--...--|--...--

[pillared_hall]
display = Pillared Hall
rows = .........|.#..#..#.|.........|.........|.#..#..#.|.........

[l_room]
display = L-Shaped Room
rows = ......|......|......|...---|...---|...---
